    "title": "Photos: No. 1 Arizona reaches first Final Four in 25 years with win against Purdue - The Daily Wildcat",
    "text": "Arizona punched their ticket to the team’s first Final Four in 25 years after beating Purdue University in San Jose, California on March 28. Koa Peat lead Arizona with 20 points, the first freshmen in history to score that many in an Elite Eight game. Four Arizona players notched 10+ points with three of them being freshmen. Arizona will now await the winner of the University of Michigan versus the University of Tennessee game in the Final Four in Indianapolis on April 4.\nCategories:\nPhotos: No. 1 Arizona reaches first Final Four in 25 years with win against Purdue\nMarch 29, 2026\nAbout the Contributor\nMason Kumet, Photo Editor",
